    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Covalent bonding occurs when <strong>two non-metal atoms</strong> share one or more pairs of electrons. These shared electrons are attracted by the nuclei of both atoms, which holds the atoms together in a molecule.</p><p>For example, two hydrogen atoms share one pair of electrons to form a hydrogen molecule (H<sub>2</sub>).</p>",
